## Reconciliation request

```json
{
  "version": 1,
  "kind": "request",
  "projects": [
    {
      "name": "composed-loop",
      "target": "echo-target@0.0.0"
    }
  ],
  "leads": [
    {
      "source": "echo",
      "lead": "echo",
      "synopsis": "echo lead from source:echo-source"
    }
  ]
}
```

## Plan context

- plan: composed-loop
- sources:
  - echo: adapter `echo-source`, value "hello"
